# Phase 2 — Implement Final RMSNorm

Input:

```text
x2 = second_residual
```

Apply the exact final RMSNorm:

```text
mean_square = sum(x2_i²) / hidden_size

inv_rms = 1 / sqrt(mean_square + epsilon)

normalized_i = x2_i * inv_rms

final_hidden_i = normalized_i * final_norm_weight_i
```

Use the already verified RMSNorm reference implementation where possible.

Do not create a second independent implementation unless necessary.

Use F32 reference arithmetic.

